# =============================================================================
# A New Multidimensional Energy Poverty Index for Mexico -- replication package
# =============================================================================

# -- Raw microdata ------------------------------------------------------------
# Not redistributed. ENIGH, CONEVAL/INEGI poverty and INEGI spatial inputs are
# public; see README.md for the download locations and the expected layout.
# Roughly 3.5 GB in total, and INEGI's terms are better served by pointing at
# the source than by mirroring it.
inputs/

# -- Reproducible intermediates ----------------------------------------------
# dt.RData is ~79 MB, above GitHub's 50 MB warning threshold and close to the
# 100 MB hard limit. It is fully reproducible by running 2_data.R, so it is not
# tracked. Do not switch this to Git LFS without a reason: the file is an
# artefact, not a source.
outputs/intermediate/

# -- Figures ------------------------------------------------------------------
# Regenerated by 4_plots.R and 1_spatial.R. Comment the next line out if you
# would rather ship the figures with the repository.
outputs/plots/

# -- Estimation output --------------------------------------------------------
# outputs/final/*.RData IS tracked: the files are small (< 200 KB in total) and
# they are what extract_for_tex.R reads, so tracking them lets a reader verify
# every number in the paper without re-running the full pipeline.
outputs/final/values_for_tex.txt

# -- R session artefacts ------------------------------------------------------
.Rhistory
.Rapp.history
.RData
.Rproj.user/
.Ruserdata
*.Rproj.user
.Renviron
.Rprofile.local

# -- renv ---------------------------------------------------------------------
# renv.lock is tracked; the library itself is not.
renv/library/
renv/local/
renv/staging/
renv/python/

# -- LaTeX --------------------------------------------------------------------
*.aux
*.bbl
*.bcf
*.blg
*.fdb_latexmk
*.fls
*.lof
*.log
*.lot
*.out
*.run.xml
*.synctex.gz
*.toc
*.pdf
!figures/*.pdf

# -- OS and editor ------------------------------------------------------------
.DS_Store
.DS_Store?
._*
.Spotlight-V100
.Trashes
Thumbs.db
ehthumbs.db
*~
*.swp
.idea/
.vscode/

# -- Review artefacts ---------------------------------------------------------
# Referee reports and internal review notes are not normally published alongside
# a replication package. Uncomment to keep them out of the repository.
# coarse.md
# *_review_*.md

# -- Scratch ------------------------------------------------------------------
scratch/
tmp/
_to_delete/
